 ## Background
-The method originates from early volume rendering systems, specifically the Shear-warp factorization approach. It was developed to optimize the computation of gradient magnitudes for edge detection and shading in real-time visualization. The specific choice of $K=1/4$ was derived from error analysis to balance accuracy across different gradient orientations [S1, unofficial].
